        "heading": "Style with Purpose",
        "text": "<p>In 2020, we launched LOOP IN—our social good platform—rooted in a simple but powerful idea: when women come together, small actions create meaningful change.</p><p>LOOP IN was created to connect LOOPERS with opportunities to give back—to “loop in” not just through what we wear, but through how we show up for our communities.</p><p>Each year, our LOOPin Grant Program supports nonprofit organizations nominated by our Looper Community—organizations doing vital, often unseen work to uplift, protect, educate, and empower. Thanks to your thoughtful nominations and continued support, we have proudly awarded our most recent LOOPin Grants and celebrated this year’s extraordinary recipients.</p><p>Every grant tells a story. Every nomination reflects a cause close to someone’s heart. Together, they form a growing circle of impact.</p><p>Our mission remains simple: to inspire LOOPERS to help make the world a better place—one intentional act at a time.</p><p>We’ll announce future nomination dates soon. Until then, we invite you to learn more, meet our recipients, and continue LOOPING IN.<br/><a href=\"/pages/about-us\" title=\"About us\">Learn More About Our Mission</a><br/><br/><a href=\"https://laloop.com/collections/shop-all\" title=\"https://laloop.com/collections/shop-all\">Shop to Support</a></p>",
